 "The camera only talks to devices it knows. Pairing introduces this device once, while the camera's Connect Device › GoPro Quik App screen is open. After that Quak connects over Bluetooth whenever the camera is on, and joins the camera's Wi-Fi only for preview and media.": "相机只与它认识的设备通信。在相机打开“连接设备 › GoPro Quik 应用（Connect Device › GoPro Quik App）”界面时配对一次，相机就会记住这台设备。之后只要相机开机，Quak 就会通过 Bluetooth 连接，并且只在预览和查看媒体时才加入相机的 Wi-Fi。",
