 "This computer is online through {device}. Joining the camera's Wi-Fi disconnects it until about a minute after you leave Media or stop the preview.": "这台电脑正通过 {device} 上网。加入相机的 Wi-Fi 后它会断网，直到您离开“媒体”或停止预览约一分钟后才恢复。",
 "This device isn't bonded with the camera and the camera isn't on its pairing screen, so it ignores the connection. On the camera open Preferences > Connections > Connect Device > GoPro Quik App, then run `quak pair`.": "此设备尚未与相机绑定，相机也未处于配对界面，因此相机忽略了连接请求。请在相机上打开首选项 > 无线连接 > 连接设备 > GoPro Quik 应用（Preferences > Connections > Connect Device > GoPro Quik App），然后运行 `quak pair`。",
